{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45435","headline":"旅中荅喻军事问客情 · 善生","name":"旅中荅喻军事问客情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一自游他国，相逢少故人。\n纵然爲客乐，争似在家贫。\n畜恨霜侵鬓，搜诗病入神。\n若非怜片善，谁肯问风尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"善生","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}